pan></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/DDO_Store\" title=\"DDO Store\">DDO Store</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/DDO_Store#Fast_Travel\" title=\"DDO Store\">Fast Travel</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Summon_Adventuring_Party\" title=\"Summon Adventuring Party\">Summon Adventuring Party</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Summon_Adventuring_Party\" title=\"Summon Adventuring Party\">Summon Adventuring Party</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 15<br /><b>Charges: </b>10</span></span> <b>—</b> 10 Charges</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Greater_Bracelet_of_Friends.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Greater_Bracelet_of_Friends.png/420px-Greater_Bracelet_of_Friends.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"408\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Greater_Bracelet_of_Friends.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This sparkling bracelet feels warm to the touch. The jewels seem to reach out to each other with an abstract pattern in the metal that makes you think of friendship and togetherness.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>Can only be used in public areas. Cannot bring anyone to locations that they do not already have access to and cannot enable anyone to travel between realms (from Eberron to the Forgotten Realms or vice versa).</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817211526\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.128 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3168/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20029/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5446/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n120.43%  136.249     40 Template:IO\n100.00%  113.137      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  113.137      1 -total\n 95.78%  108.363      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 40.18%   45.460      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 39.46%   44.649      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 38.75%   43.843      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 37.95%   42.940      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.60%   19.908      1 Template:Mat\n 17.19%   19